    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a piece about the future of work and how ai is basically going to automate most sectors. i want to frame the piece around the idea that this technological shift is an inevitable social evolution that we just have to adapt to. can u help me outline some of the key reasons why this transition is pretty much set in stone from a tech standpoint?",
